    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frontline Footage</strong> is a tactical first-person shooter that throws you directly into the action, featuring a unique bodycam perspective. Developed by <strong>D4rkSt0rm Studios</strong>, the game puts you in the boots of <strong>Jos\u00e9 Herrera</strong>, a rookie officer of Ecuador's GOE (Special Operations Group), as you uncover a conspiracy threatening to destabilize the nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>, <i>Frontline Footage</i> delivers a stunning visual experience, with meticulously detailed environments ranging from the streets of Quito to secret military installations. This isn't just a shooter; it's a highly realistic combat experience where stealth, precision, and teamwork are essential for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The missions are designed to challenge both your tactical skills and moral decisions. As you progress, you\u2019ll confront the harsh realities of corruption and personal sacrifice, making every bullet fired and every enemy defeated carry weight in the unfolding narrative.</p>",
